direction: down
title: iron-feather v0 - one shard over Flight (+ Poem OGC)

client: PyArrow client (DoGet ticket)
flight: Flight server (this repo, serve)
duckdb: DuckDB prebuilt lib
http: HTTP Parquet (OSM slice)
poem: Poem OGC API (same lineage core)
demo: demo.duckdb (same slice, local)

client -> flight: ticket JSON
flight -> duckdb: SQL + lineage + bbox
duckdb -> http: range scans
poem -> demo: local shard file
